# W44-phase3-B1 — CPU vs GPU butteraugli backend A/B bench

Date: 2026-05-23
Host: AMD Ryzen 9 7950X + RTX 5070 (Blackwell sm_120, 12 GB), WSL2 Ubuntu, CUDA 13.2
Encoder build: jxl-encoder w44-phase3-b1 sibling workspace, release profile, time-iters=2 (best-of-N reported)
Threads: 1 (single-threaded for like-for-like CPU vs GPU timing)

