sRGB-u8 round-trip causes ~0.02-0.05% drift in butteraugli scores
(W44-RECON-DEEP/A7 measured this floor empirically), which moves the
buttloop's quant_field convergence to slightly different local optima.
Decoded pixels per W44-RECON-DEEP/A11 remain byte-equivalent within
ULP-scale XYB perturbations; SSIM2 deltas are all within ±0.4.

